
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetLocalPos(): vector`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`vector llGetLocalPos();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a vector that is the position relative (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Local" target="_blank">local</a>) to the root.</p>
  <p>If called from the root prim it returns the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Region" target="_blank">position in the region</a> unless it is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAttached" target="_blank">attached</a> to which it returns the position relative to the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Attachments" target="_blank">attach point</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">60</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local vIntTouched = #events
    local vStrMessage = "The touched prim is "
    if ll.DetectedLinkNumber(0) > 1 then
        vStrMessage ..= tostring(ll.VecMag(ll.GetLocalPos())) .. "m from "
    end
    ll.Say(0, vStrMessage .. "the root prim")
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    touch_start(integer vIntTouched)
    {
        string vStrMessage = "The touched prim is ";
        if (llDetectedLinkNumber(0) > 1)
        {
            vStrMessage += (string)llVecMag(llGetLocalPos()) + "m from ";
        }
        llSay(0, vStrMessage + "the root prim");
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Useful Snippets</h2>
  <p>There is no function to set the position of a prim local to itself.
To set the position of a prim local to itself you would have to do something like:</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function SetPositionLocalToCurrentPosition(local_position)
    ll.SetPos(ll.GetLocalPos() + (local_position * ll.GetLocalRot()))
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`SetPositionLocalToCurrentPosition(vector local_position)
{
    llSetPos(llGetLocalPos() + (local_position * llGetLocalRot()));
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <p>Or:</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function SetPositionLocalToCurrentPosition(local_position)
    ll.SetPos(ll.GetPos() + (local_position * ll.GetRot()))
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`SetPositionLocalToCurrentPosition(vector local_position)
{
    llSetPos(llGetPos() + (local_position * llGetRot()));
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
